</div></div>
<div class="rise-project">
<div class="rise-details">
<p>Sunstone RISE was a career guidance initiative designed for students from Classes 11 and 12, providing structured guidance through academic preparation, career exploration and scholarship opportunities.</p>
<p>I developed the written communication for the initiative, including its brochure and school outreach email, translating the programme's offerings and four-stage structure into clear, engaging messaging for students and educational institutions.</p>
<h3>PROGRAMME &amp; BROCHURE COPY</h3>
<p>Developed the content explaining the four stages of the RISE initiative:</p>
<ul>
<li>Junior UG Program – An introduction to undergraduate education and what lies ahead.</li>
<li>Board Exam Prep – Tips, toolkits and expert guidance for board examinations.</li>
<li>Career Coach – Counselling to help students better understand their career options.</li>
<li>National Scholarship Test – An opportunity to compete for scholarships worth up to ₹1 crore.</li>
</ul>
<h3>SCHOOL OUTREACH COMMUNICATION</h3>
<p>Developed the outreach email introducing Sunstone RISE to schools, explaining the programme's objectives, its educational components and the proposed partnership with institutions.</p>
<h3>MY CONTRIBUTION</h3>
<ul>
<li>Complete copywriting for the RISE brochure.</li>
<li>Content development and messaging for all four programme stages.</li>
<li>Writing and structuring programme descriptions and student benefits.</li>
<li>Copywriting for school outreach and partnership communication.</li>
<li>Developing clear messaging for students, parents and educational institutions.</li>
</ul>
<p class="rise-credit">My contribution covered the written content and copywriting for the brochure and school outreach communication.</p>
</div>
